      "entity_id": "781FECAB-162E-4941-A61E-F7D9C08F5273",
      "name": "The Sound of Music Live",
      "properties": {
        "release_year": 2015,
        "description": "The Sound of Music Live is a 2015 live television stage production of the Rodgers and Hammerstein musical, shown in the United States on PBS in 2018. The televised special stars Kara Tointon, Julian Ovenden and Alexander Armstrong and follows an apprentice nun who becomes governess to a widowed naval captain's children. The production restores elements of the original stage score and foregrounds family, faith and moral courage as Nazism encroaches on Austria. Praised for its live theatrical staging and strong ensemble singing, it delivers a warm, nostalgic emotional tone."
