      "name": "The Sound of 007",
      "properties": {
        "release_year": 2022,
        "description": "The Sound of 007 (2022), directed by Mat Whitecross, is a documentary about six decades of music from the James Bond films. Featuring interviews and appearances by figures such as Daniel Craig, Michael Caine and Rami Malek alongside composers and performers, the film traces the creation and evolution of the franchise's signature sound. It blends archival footage, behind-the-scenes anecdotes and musicological insight to explore collaboration, legacy and cultural impact, delivering a nostalgic yet analytical tone."
